<!-- ============ AI CLIENTELING ============ -->
<section class="section aix aix-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="aix-head">
      <span class="aix-badge">AI</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">The most knowledgeable coworker on your floor.</h2>
      <p>An AI assistant on the associate's handheld. Associates ask it the way they would ask a colleague and get an answer, with pictures, in seconds, so they spend less time searching and more time with the customer.</p>
    </div>

        <div class="aix-split">
      <ul class="aix-points aix-points-l">
        <li><b>Ask in plain language</b><span>"Something warm for a weekend in the mountains" brings back the products that fit.</span></li>
